 ## Background
-This method was introduced by Marc Levoy in his work on volume rendering using the Fourier Projection-Slice Theorem [S1, S2]. It extends the basic Fourier projection-slice volume rendering technique to include Phong-like shading models [S1]. The approach leverages the linearity of the Fourier projection operator to decompose the non-linear specular term into a sum of linear terms [S2].
